							<div class="jddm-c-check-style">
								<h3>Why clean code became one of my biggest lessons</h3>
								<p>During my internship, I learned that clean code is more than making a project look organized. It makes development easier to understand, debug, and improve. By following consistent naming, formatting, and structure, I became more confident when working on unfamiliar code and collaborating with other developers.</p>
