										</svg>	
										Use meaningful variable and function names
									</li>
									<li>
										<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
											<path d="M6.36641 12.0001L2.56641 8.20007L3.51641 7.25007L6.36641 10.1001L12.4831 3.9834L13.4331 4.9334L6.36641 12.0001Z" fill="currentColor"/>
